<title>NETHERLANDS: KPN details 1996 stock dividend.</title>
<headline>KPN details 1996 stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch post and telecoms group Koninklijke PTT Nederland (KPN) said on Thursday it had set its 1996 optional final stock dividend at one new share per 39 held.</p>
<p>In March, KPN announced it would pay a 1996 cash dividend of 2.85 guilders, of which one guilder had already been paid as an interim dividend. The final payment could be taken up in cash or an optional dividend in new shares.</p>
<p>KPN shares closed at 69.90 guilders on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange on Thursday, unchanged from their previous close.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 (fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
